1
00:00:00,244 --> 00:00:02,214
(Penny:)Okay, everybody,

2
00:00:02,213 --> 00:00:03,443
(Penny:)Sheldon is gonna come back out,

3
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:04,777
(Penny:)but I think
he's a little embarrassed,

4
00:00:04,782 --> 00:00:07,412
(Penny:)so let's all be
extra nice, okay?

5
00:00:07,418 --> 00:00:08,848
(Barry:)What are you
looking at me for?

6
00:00:08,853 --> 00:00:10,283
I'm a saint. (chuckles)

7
00:00:10,287 --> 00:00:12,287
(Barry:)But a sinner in the sack.

8
00:00:16,293 --> 00:00:17,593
(Sheldon:)Hello, everyone.

9
00:00:17,595 --> 00:00:18,695
I-I...

10
00:00:18,696 --> 00:00:20,566
(Sheldon:)I'd like to apologize
for my behavior.

11
00:00:20,564 --> 00:00:23,294
(Sheldon:)I hope it hasn't put
a damper on the party.

12
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,270
So, just, please,
enjoy yourselves.

13
00:00:25,269 --> 00:00:26,439
That's good.

14
00:00:26,437 --> 00:00:29,907
(party chatter resumes)

15
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:32,307
(Sheldon:)Oh, this is quickly
getting out of hand.

16
00:00:32,309 --> 00:00:34,379
(Amy:)If I may,

17
00:00:34,378 --> 00:00:36,678
I-I'd like to propose a toast.

18
00:00:36,681 --> 00:00:39,081
(Amy:)Um, thank you all
for coming tonight.

19
00:00:39,083 --> 00:00:40,153
(Amy:)I know it's customary

20
00:00:40,151 --> 00:00:43,081
(Amy:)for the birthday boy
to receive presents,

21
00:00:43,087 --> 00:00:45,317
(Amy:)but I feel like I got
the greatest gift

22
00:00:45,322 --> 00:00:46,692
(Amy:)the day he was born.

23
00:00:46,691 --> 00:00:47,721
ALL:
Aw.

24
00:00:47,725 --> 00:00:49,725
Hear, hear.
KOOTHRAPPALI: Cheers.

25
00:00:49,727 --> 00:00:52,057
(Sheldon:)Amy, that was lovely.

26
00:00:52,063 --> 00:00:53,563
(Sheldon:)You know,

27
00:00:53,564 --> 00:00:54,534
(Sheldon:)this is fun.

28
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:55,702
(Sheldon:)Let's do more.

29
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,020
(Sheldon:)Someone else say something
wonderful about me.

